    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36743" root="كدح" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَدْحٌ</span></b>  <i>A scratch,</i> or <i>laceration, of the skin;
i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَدْشٌ</span>: (S, K:) or a <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَدْح</span> is <i>more</i> (or
<i>larger,</i> L) <i>than a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَدْش</span>: (S:) <i>any mark made
by scratching</i> or <i>biting:</i> (IAth:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُدُوحٌ</span>.
(S, K.) Ex. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ كَدْحٌ</span>, (S, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُدُوحٌ</span>, (S,)
<i>He has upon him a scratch, &amp;c.</i> (S, K.)

